  "description": "Chipmunk soul: the hip hop of the early 2000s at 80 to 96 BPM, built on soul records sped up until their singers' voices rise: a hard programmed kick, a snare and a clap cracking together on two and four, crisp hats, a deep bass under the sample's chords, horn stabs and strings in the hooks, verses and hooks",
